source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Let go of items in Reading, or of everything in the edition with --all. Preview with --dry-run; `mxr undo` reverses it

Usage: mxr reading let-go [OPTIONS] [ITEM]...

Arguments:
  [ITEM]...

Options:
      --all
      --dry-run
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
